        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    from math import comb\n\n    interested_recipients = 200\n    applicants = 10\n    application_probability = 0.05\n\n    # Calculate the binomial probability and convert it to a percentage\n    probability = (\n        comb(interested_recipients, applicants)\n        * application_probability**applicants\n        * (1 - application_probability) ** (interested_recipients - applicants)\n    )\n    answer = round(probability * 100, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
